Copyright 2026 Kernelcraft LLC (PolicyWinds) and licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Credit: "PolicyWinds labeler eval set, https://github.com/policywinds/labeler".

Not covered by that license:

- texts/: official bill texts published by state legislatures and by the U.S. Government Publishing Office
  (GovInfo). They are government documents, reproduced unchanged except for conversion to plain text
  (struck-out text marked "[deleted: ...]"). Each file's source URL is in bills.jsonl.
- Bill titles, descriptions and sponsor names in bills.jsonl: data from LegiScan (https://legiscan.com),
  licensed CC BY 4.0, originally published by the legislatures.

The Python scripts in this folder are licensed under Apache-2.0, like the rest of the repository (../LICENSE).
